# ============================================================================
# common/structural/profile — FROZEN profile-descriptor contract v1
#
# Architecture §17.3 (SpatialLayoutProfile), §18 (ResolveProfile), §26 group
# 11 ("ResolveProfile and SpatialLayoutProfile contracts"). Contract document:
# doc/05_design/platform/structural_compute/profile_contract_v1.md
#
# This module holds only the language-neutral descriptor records. The
# behavioural traits stay with their owning lanes (`resolve/resolve_types.spl`
# for LINK, `layout/profile.spl` for LAYOUT) and are not re-exported here.
#
# Explicit re-exports only — no `export use *`, which the linter flags for
# exposing unnecessary interface.
# ============================================================================

